{"n":49,"kurals":[{"n":481,"l":["பகல்வெல்லும் கூகையைக் காக்கை இகல்வெல்லும்","வேந்தர்க்கு வேண்டும் பொழுது."],"w":[["பகல்வெல்லும்",1,"Pakalvellum","by day/in daytime; (that) wins/defeats — qualifies காக்கை"],["கூகையைக்",1,"Kookaiyaik","the owl (object)"],["காக்கை",1,"Kaakkai","the crow"],["இகல்வெல்லும்",1,"Ikalvellum","enmity/hostility (object); (who) wins — qualifies வேந்தர்"],["வேந்தர்க்கு",2,"Vendharkku","for kings"],["வேண்டும்",2,"Ventum","is needed/required"],["பொழுது",2,"Pozhudhu","the (right) time"]]},{"n":482,"l":["பருவத்தோடு ஒட்ட ஒழுகல் திருவினைத்","தீராமை ஆர்க்குங் கயிறு."],"w":[["பருவத்தோடு",1,"Paruvaththotu","with the (right) time/season"],["ஒட்ட",1,"Otta","so as to accord/match"],["ஒழுகல்",1,"Ozhukal","conducting (oneself)/acting"],["திருவினைத்",1,"Thiruvinaith","wealth/fortune (object)"],["தீராமை",2,"Theeraamai","so as not to leave/depart"],["ஆர்க்குங்",2,"Aarkkung","(that) binds/ties — qualifies கயிறு"],["கயிறு",2,"Kayiru","rope/cord"]]},{"n":483,"l":["அருவினை யென்ப உளவோ கருவியான்","காலம் அறிந்து செயின்."],"w":[["அருவினை",1,"Aruvinai","hard deeds/difficult tasks"],["யென்ப",1,"Yenpa","they say/are said to be"],["உளவோ",1,"Ulavo","do (they) exist; (interrogative ō)"],["கருவியான்",1,"Karuviyaan","by means/with the tools"],["காலம்",2,"Kaalam","the (right) time (object) — உருபு மறைந்தது"],["அறிந்து",2,"Arindhu","having known"],["செயின்",2,"Seyin","if one does/acts"]]},{"n":484,"l":["ஞாலம் கருதினுங் கைகூடுங் காலம்","கருதி இடத்தாற் செயின்."],"w":[["ஞாலம்",1,"Gnaalam","the world (object) — உருபு மறைந்தது"],["கருதினுங்",1,"Karudhinung","if (one) intends; even (concessive)"],["கைகூடுங்",1,"Kaikootung","will be achieved/come to hand"],["காலம்",1,"Kaalam","the (right) time (object) — உருபு மறைந்தது"],["கருதி",2,"Karudhi","having considered"],["இடத்தாற்",2,"Itaththaar","with/by the (right) place"],["செயின்",2,"Seyin","if one does/acts"]]},{"n":485,"l":["காலம் கருதி இருப்பர் கலங்காது","ஞாலம் கருது பவர்."],"w":[["காலம்",1,"Kaalam","the (right) time (object) — உருபு மறை